.TH CHTTPCLI_CONSTRUCT 3 "2026-07-10" "c_collections" "C Collections Library - Macros"
.SH NAME
chttpcli_construct \- declare and initialize a chttpcli handle
.SH LIBRARY
C Collections (libccollections, \-lccollections)
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
#include <ccollections/chttpclient.h>

chttpcli_construct(name)
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
.nf
This macro declares a chttpcli variable with the name name. It then
calls ccol_create_chttpclient at once to initialize that variable. If
the creation fails, the macro calls ccol_fatal_err() and does not
return.
.fi
.SH PARAMETERS
.nf
name     The identifier of the new handle variable.
.fi
.SH "SEE ALSO"
.BR chttpcli_construct_scoped (3),
.BR chttpcli_declare (3),
.BR ccol_create_chttpclient (3)
